il_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/61c90903/uploads/origins/aafb0216-82e0-4c23-bc8d-f96747f747db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0d04503c3e3e332b7c1d5c340a07788, https://si.imgix.net/61c90903/uploads/origins/aafb0216-82e0-4c23-bc8d-f96747f747db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=be7da60af9b1a2b0d166ac2e84f351cf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/61c90903/uploads/origins/aafb0216-82e0-4c23-bc8d-f96747f747db?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df3d94c24d0a329c53b282b080587622 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "先日は配信お疲れさまでした！\n工藤さんの綺麗な絵が描きあがっていく様子を見れた事がとても嬉しかったです！\n\n今回はSkebでの募集を再開なされているということで、Skebの方でリクエストさせていただきます。\n以下の内容のイラストをお願いします。\n\n【キャラ】\nデレマスの相葉夕美\n\n【服装】\nモバマスSR[青春の応援花]相葉夕美の特訓後衣装\n\n【ポーズ】\n前かがみの姿勢で立っている相葉さんに見つめられている\n（資料URLの参考画像のようなイメージです）\n\n【その他】\n指定がない条件に関しては工藤さんにお任せします。\n\nシャドウバンという不幸が続いていたり、冬コミの準備があったり大変な状況かとは思いますが、\n検討していただけると幸いです。\nまた、シャドウバンが早く解除される事を祈っています。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1qbmMQP_KSXD_vS8_xwVcf63KGPVf2-xY?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kudo_eru/works/47", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/0f433c2e/uploads/origins/9855585f-c2da-4db1-88c8-1133280ccfb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cbeba7c28ecdfee72945cea2dcb82aa", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/0f433c2e/uploads/origins/9855585f-c2da-4db1-88c8-1133280ccfb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0cbeba7c28ecdfee72945cea2dcb82aa, https://si.imgix.net/0f433c2e/uploads/origins/9855585f-c2da-4db1-88c8-1133280ccfb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0019aaa771ce3c8b67bffb6303ed8da8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0f433c2e/uploads/origins/9855585f-c2da-4db1-88c8-1133280ccfb7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea6715970cce911552769e487b9f71ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi 工藤える-さん!\nMy friend and I are huge fans of your charming art work ♡\nCould you please draw our characters together?\n\nReimi has ocean blue eyes and brown hair with fair skin. She is elegant and gentle. Her dress is pure white with a silver floral accent.\nOphelia has ruby red eyes and milk tea colored hair. Her skin is a light tan. She is fun and eccentric. Her dress is pastel purple with transparent lace.\n\nIf background is included, can you create a simple sky with flower petals in the wind? We are ok with no background as well. We would like for you to pick the pose.\n\nPlease draw freely, take your time and make any adjustments you need. Thank you so much for considering our request ♡\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/Ned33o4", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kudo_eru/works/46", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee1d8d9e/uploads/origins/54f8a54e-33b0-4c85-9e24-773090fa1265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e1fd1e2c838390ea6d983df20ccab4af", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ee1d8d9e/uploads/origins/54f8a54e-33b0-4c85-9e24-773090fa1265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=e1fd1e2c838390ea6d983df20ccab4af, https://si.imgix.net/ee1d8d9e/uploads/origins/54f8a54e-33b0-4c85-9e24-773090fa1265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=778d2e1569d729bfd5013e613033220e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ee1d8d9e/uploads/origins/54f8a54e-33b0-4c85-9e24-773090fa1265?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=42430c6d